{"parse": {"title": "末日与末日之后-07", "pageid": 101320, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-06\" title=\"末日与末日之后-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">末日与末日之后-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-08\" title=\"末日与末日之后-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">末日与末日之后</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.9C.E6.96.B9.E7.9A.84.E6.B6.88.E6.81.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"远方的消息\">远方的消息</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 远方的消息</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Message from Afar</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>安东、尤利娅！<br />和你们嘱咐过多少遍，怎么这么不听话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>这么远的路，万一遇到什么危险可怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对妇人的责问，年纪大些的男孩指向门外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>我们不是自己来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>伊利沙和我们一起！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-612020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-612020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-612020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊利沙：</div><div>汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我真是拿你们这两个孩子没办法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人哭笑不得地揉了揉额头，两双好奇的大眼睛已经将注意力投向了屋里的库珀花环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>她是达莎姐姐吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>姐姐，找到了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人敲了敲他们的小脑瓜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>你们怎么又来了，见人就乱认姐姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>达莎姐姐要想长成像这个姐姐这么高，还要再过好些年呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旁观了这亲子间互动的库珀花环会心一笑，但随即一个疑问涌上心头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>拉瑞莎女士，这两位小朋友是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>这是我的二儿子安东，旁边的是他妹妹尤利娅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>别看他俩瞧着乖巧，其实都是小淘气包，想来是继承了阿尔谢尼的那股劲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>你好，大姐姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>姐姐好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>原来是这样，你们好。<br />但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环思索着该如何措辞才不显冒犯，她口袋里的小生物却不用考虑太多社交礼仪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>可你丈夫不是已经死了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>你们是怎么在那之后生出这两个小不点来的？<br />我是说……呃，这是怎么做到的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>蝾螈先生！这样问有些太不礼貌了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忐忑地望向妇人，见她先是愕然地瞪大了眼睛，随后大笑出声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>哦……天哪！是我的错，你们误会了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>虽然留下了一些后遗症，导致他出门不大方便了……但阿尔谢尼还活着，活得好好的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_wurenkuangqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-633511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-633511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-633511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>当时我跟着他们匆匆忙忙地穿过宿舍，看到阿尔谢尼躺在雪里，雪是红的……之后的事我一概记不得了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-633511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-633511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-633511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>但他们说是我为阿尔谢尼止了血，还用他们这辈子都没听过的大嗓门喊人把他送去医院……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>现在想想，我都佩服我自己。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>原来是这么一回事儿呀！<br />你说得太让人误解了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>含章鼎甩了甩头，如释重负。<br />短暂的错愕后，库珀花环也绽开了笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>原来阿尔谢尼先生还活着，那真是太好了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>还活着，还能够见到面、说上话……没有比这更好的事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她又将目光望向那两个小不点——他们现在正兴趣盎然地盯着含章鼎瞧个不停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>安东、尤利娅……都是好名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>看来是我杞人忧天了，我还以为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她还以为面前的妇人仍被囚禁在旧日的风雪中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许此刻举棋不定的她并没有资格这样说，但在心底的深处，她始终明白——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>生活总是要继续，我们都要向前看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我想念我的达莎，从未放弃过寻找她，有时也会为此落泪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>但我仍会和阿尔谢尼，还有这些孩子们一起好好生活，努力让一切变得更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看向一旁的两个幼子，眼中添上了几抹复杂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>……在他们出生时，我曾想过达莎是否会为此责备我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>怎么会呢！<br />您是这样好的人，您的女儿达莎也一定是个好孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这一切并不是您的错，达莎肯定不会希望您不幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>至少如果是我，我希望那些我爱的人，以及爱我的人都能够幸福……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恍然间，库珀花环心中一动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>是呀。<br />这也许是我们一厢情愿的臆测，但我想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>被爱连在一起的人是心意相通的，爱着我们的人同样希望我们幸福。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>这个家里大女儿的位置永远会为达莎留着。<br />我爱着她，就像我爱着阿尔谢尼、爱着安东和尤利娅一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>而我知道他们也爱着我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>嗯？是呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>当然！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个孩子蹦蹦跳跳地扑了过去，于是妇人将他们揽入怀中，难为情似的笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>很长一段时间我都耿耿于怀，结果还是这些孩子们让我终于明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>——正是我们获得的爱，让我们拥有战胜苦难的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>因此我们才能够继续向前，同时仍被允许怀念过去，仍被允许心怀希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起头望向库珀花环，闪着关切的目光被窗外透进来的阳光照亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>孩子，我不知道你的身上发生了什么，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>也许你愿意和我说说吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一瞬间，库珀花环竟产生了一种仿佛自己也置身于那怀抱中的错觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但“暴雨”的真相不被允许向外人泄露，库珀花环最终只是摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我……在找一个马戏团，乌特恩亚亚马戏团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>不过看起来我找错地方了，他们不在这里——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>乌特恩亚亚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>我们知道乌特恩亚亚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>稚嫩的惊呼声出乎意料地响起，两个孩子七手八脚地翻出一张皱巴巴的海报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这是……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海报上熟悉的字样让库珀花环再移不开眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>真的是乌特恩亚亚！<br />但……为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>因为你找错地方了，大姐姐。<br />你看，上面写着“带给您最精彩的演出，坎达拉克沙市，不见不散……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>演出是在坎达拉克沙，不在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>我们也想看演出，但是邮差哥哥说我们赶不上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>他说那里有好远好远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>让我看看……哎呀，还真的是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人接过海报，最终对孩子们遗憾地摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>演出七点就要开始了，可坎达拉克沙离这里有二百多公里，现在过去已经来不及了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>这样吧。<br />我会让邮差哥哥留心马戏团的消息，等他们下次演出，我们就会提前知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>到时候我再带你们去，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>说好了哦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个孩子乖巧地点了点头，但库珀花环看得出他们眼神中的失落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>等等，也许……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摸上自己的口袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>也许我可以带你们去看演出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>去看乌特恩亚亚的演出。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "末日与末日之后-07"}}